    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- Prologue -</strong></h2>Orchi, a young snail-girl, wakes up in the middle of nowhere. Completely lost, she decides to roam around, looking for a way home. Luckily, she has her mallet ready for battle. However, not everything goes to plan.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- Features -</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A unique cast of characters!<br></li><li>A Vibrant, varied world with unique environments!<br></li><li>Unlockable abilities!<br></li><li>Weapon upgrades!<br></li><li>Build variety!<br></li><li>Special bossfights!<br></li><li>Multiple endings!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- Find powerful trinkets -</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2504450/extras/3f1bbc991d92d83cc81a6c55ea0c3264.poster.avif?t=1738407827\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2504450/extras/3f1bbc991d92d83cc81a6c55ea0c3264.webm?t=1738407827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2504450/extras/3f1bbc991d92d83cc81a6c55ea0c3264.mp4?t=1738407827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>She might not look like it, but orchi loves to collect the diverse trinkets! You gotta work for them though! Maybe there's one hidden behind a breakable wall, through a ceiling or maybe as a reward from a familiar face!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- Assemble and combine! -</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2504450/extras/071b826e79c9de74c1d8bee7dfd4f1ef.poster.avif?t=1738407827\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2504450/extras/071b826e79c9de74c1d8bee7dfd4f1ef.webm?t=1738407827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2504450/extras/071b826e79c9de74c1d8bee7dfd4f1ef.mp4?t=1738407827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Combine shiny trinkets and abilities to create cool builds to use for exploration, secret hunting, or even for KO'ing foes!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- Your adventure, your playstyle -</strong></h2><br>Slug Gear has a high focus on build-variety and is open for different playstyles! Whether you want to be a combo maniac, a summoner or a stance user, all is fair game!",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- Prologue -</strong></h2>Orchi, a young snail-girl, wakes up in the middle of nowhere. Completely lost, she decides to roam around, looking for a way home. Luckily, she has her mallet ready for battle. However, not everything goes to plan.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- Features -</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A unique cast of characters!<br></li><li>A Vibrant, varied world with unique environments!<br></li><li>Unlockable abilities!<br></li><li>Weapon upgrades!<br></li><li>Build variety!<br></li><li>Special bossfights!<br></li><li>Multiple endings!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- Find powerful trinkets -</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2504450/extras/3f1bbc991d92d83cc81a6c55ea0c3264.poster.avif?t=1738407827\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2504450/extras/3f1bbc991d92d83cc81a6c55ea0c3264.webm?t=1738407827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2504450/extras/3f1bbc991d92d83cc81a6c55ea0c3264.mp4?t=1738407827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>She might not look like it, but orchi loves to collect the diverse trinkets! You gotta work for them though! Maybe there's one hidden behind a breakable wall, through a ceiling or maybe as a reward from a familiar face!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- Assemble and combine! -</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2504450/extras/071b826e79c9de74c1d8bee7dfd4f1ef.poster.avif?t=1738407827\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2504450/extras/071b826e79c9de74c1d8bee7dfd4f1ef.webm?t=1738407827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2504450/extras/071b826e79c9de74c1d8bee7dfd4f1ef.mp4?t=1738407827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Combine shiny trinkets and abilities to create cool builds to use for exploration, secret hunting, or even for KO'ing foes!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- Your adventure, your playstyle -</strong></h2><br>Slug Gear has a high focus on build-variety and is open for different playstyles! Whether you want to be a combo maniac, a summoner or a stance user, all is fair game!",
    "short_description": "Slug Gear is an action-packed Metroidvania within a universe of insect-human hybrids. Collect unique trinkets, fight powerful bosses and discover the lost lore of the world!",
